N/A ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])|theme=uncommon}}'''Monster is''' an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife obtainable by purchasing the 10th tier of the Battle Pass of the [[Halloween Event 2024]]. It costs 7,200 [[Candies (2024)|candies]]{{Currency|Candies2024|25px}} in total.

== Appearance ==
It has a green edge on the blade with spiky teeth emerging from it, this is similar to a monster’s mouth, hence the name. The blade and the guard are dark green.
